<title>CHILE: Colbun Q1 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Colbun Q1 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean hydroelectric power company Colbun SA reported the following results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>		    Q1 1997		   Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net loss	   6.4	     profit 1.3</p>
<p>Oper loss	  8.7	     profit 2.3</p>
<p>Non-oper profit  1.2	     loss     878 million</p>
<p>Total revenues   10.9			11.6</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted. ((-- Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
</text>
